        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Abanico de \"diseño mandarín\" ver: _DeLeo, Thomas: \"Letters to the Editor\"  en FANS, The Bulletin of The Fan Circle International. Summer 2008, nº 86, p.5.  \n  \nBibliografía comparada:  \n- HUTT, Julia: \"Chinese fans and fans from China\" en  FANS FROM THE EAST, England, London,  Debrett´s Peerage Ltd., 1978. p.35,  nº 14.  \n- MERINO DE CÁCERES, Maruja: Orientals fans in the Natinal Museum of Decorative Arts in Madrid. En: FANS, The Bulletin of Fan Circle International. Londres, 2007, nº 85 pp. 22-29"@es ;
